  {
   "id": "scen197.0001",
   "jp": "{FFEE}王母とエリオットを守りながら敵を倒せ！{FFF1}",
   "en": "{FFEE}Defeat the enemy while protecting the Queen Mother{n}and Elliot!{FFF1}",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen197.0002",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:0005}私は今まで戦ったことがありません。{n}このようなときにはどうすればよいのでしょう？",
   "en": "...{v:0005}I have never fought before. What should I do in a{n}situation like this?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen197.0003",
   "jp": "王母アンジェラに、どのように指示しますか？",
   "en": "What orders will you give Queen Mother Angela?",
   "term": "end"
  },
  {
